  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 2.61,
      "end": 5.89,
      "text": "Think back to your first day at primary school.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.232017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003681
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 5.89,
      "end": 9.73,
      "text": "For many of us, it's one of our clearest childhood memories.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.232017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003681
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 9.73,
      "end": 13.33,
      "text": "Oh, that's me waving goodbye to my proud mum.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.232017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003681
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 13.33,
      "end": 18.29,
      "text": "But the fact is we really can't trust our childhood memories.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.232017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003681
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 18.29,
      "end": 20.85,
      "text": "Because for these early memories,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.232017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003681
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 20.85,
      "end": 24.97,
      "text": "gaps appear and our brains fill in the details.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.232017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003681
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 24.97,
      "end": 28.97,
      "text": "Before long, memories can become a mishmash of your memories,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.232017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003681
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 28.97,
      "end": 30.81,
      "text": "those of your friends and family,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.232017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003681
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 31.09,
      "end": 33.53,
      "text": "and photos or home videos.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.193866,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000286
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 34.65,
      "end": 37.37,
      "text": "So what you think happened can be quite different",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.193866,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000286
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 37.37,
      "end": 39.73,
      "text": "from the reality you actually lived through.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.193866,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000286
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 41.41,
      "end": 44.17,
      "text": "To understand why you can't trust your memories,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.193866,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000286
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 44.17,
      "end": 47.37,
      "text": "we need to ask what a memory actually is.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.193866,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000286
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 47.37,
      "end": 50.41,
      "text": "So people often think that memories are sort of these physical structures",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.193866,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000286
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 50.41,
      "end": 53.17,
      "text": "that live in the brain, almost like something in a computer,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.193866,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000286
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 53.17,
      "end": 56.09,
      "text": "like a file that you can go and open and find.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.193866,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000286
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 56.09,
      "end": 59.81,
      "text": "Instead, the memories actually live as networks",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.193866,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000286
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 59.81,
      "end": 61.93,
      "text": "that are distributed across the brain.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.200721,
      "no_speech_prob": 5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 61.93,
      "end": 65.49,
      "text": "And so when you're especially reliving a memory of your life,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.200721,
      "no_speech_prob": 5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 65.49,
      "end": 68.77,
      "text": "you are accessing often lots of different parts of your brain,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.200721,
      "no_speech_prob": 5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 68.77,
      "end": 71.89,
      "text": "which all lead you to be able to have a full,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.200721,
      "no_speech_prob": 5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 71.89,
      "end": 75.01,
      "text": "complex representation of what happened.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.200721,
      "no_speech_prob": 5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 75.01,
      "end": 76.97,
      "text": "So some of the brain cells that were activated",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.200721,
      "no_speech_prob": 5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 76.97,
      "end": 81.53,
      "text": "during my actual experience are reactivated when I remember it.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.200721,
      "no_speech_prob": 5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 82.81,
      "end": 86.25,
      "text": "Clusters of brain cells that form a memory are linked up.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.200721,
      "no_speech_prob": 5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 86.29,
      "end": 90.25,
      "text": "And each time we remember, these links become stronger.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152419,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000213
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 90.25,
      "end": 93.33,
      "text": "But strong doesn't always mean stable.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152419,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000213
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 93.33,
      "end": 98.13,
      "text": "For a long time, people thought that if you stored something",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152419,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000213
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 98.13,
      "end": 103.65,
      "text": "in your long-term memory, it was pretty much there permanently.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152419,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000213
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 103.65,
      "end": 107.81,
      "text": "But that pretty much got shattered when it became clear",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152419,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000213
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 107.81,
      "end": 112.93,
      "text": "that there wasn't very good evidence for the permanence of memory in the first place.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152419,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000213
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 112.93,
      "end": 116.3,
      "text": "Four years of piano lessons.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152419,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000213
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 116.3,
      "end": 117.34,
      "text": "Yeah, it looks pretty faded.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152419,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000213
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 117.34,
      "end": 121.22,
      "text": "You know what? Save chopsticks and heart and soul, get rid of the rest.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.147005,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000121
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 121.22,
      "end": 124.82,
      "text": "So our memories aren't fixed or permanent.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.147005,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000121
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 124.82,
      "end": 127.58,
      "text": "And in fact, they're always changing.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.147005,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000121
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 127.58,
      "end": 131.74,
      "text": "We're essentially reconstructing our narrative rather than reliving it.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.147005,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000121
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 131.74,
      "end": 133.66,
      "text": "This we refer to as reconciliation,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.147005,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000121
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 133.66,
      "end": 138.22,
      "text": "and we refer to as pulling up this memory network, accessing it,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.147005,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000121
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 138.22,
      "end": 140.62,
      "text": "and actually laying it down again.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.147005,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000121
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 140.62,
      "end": 144.86,
      "text": "And every time you reconcile it, every time you put this network back down,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.147005,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000121
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 144.86,
      "end": 147.06,
      "text": "you're actually able to change it.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.147005,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000121
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 147.1,
      "end": 151.5,
      "text": "And this tendency for memories to change is hugely important.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000249
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 151.5,
      "end": 153.46,
      "text": "And it's totally natural.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000249
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 153.46,
      "end": 155.58,
      "text": "It happens to everyone.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000249
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 155.58,
      "end": 159.3,
      "text": "But it's possible to manipulate this process.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000249
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 159.3,
      "end": 166.38,
      "text": "You can supply people with misinformation that can change their memory.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000249
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 166.38,
      "end": 169.66,
      "text": "You can ask them leading or suggestive questions",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000249
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 169.66,
      "end": 174.62,
      "text": "that insinuate that there were details present, that there weren't.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.133189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000249
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 174.62,
      "end": 178.26,
      "text": "Out there in the real world, people are exposed to media coverage",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00259
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 178.26,
      "end": 182.86,
      "text": "where they get ideas about an event, maybe a high publicity event",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00259
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 182.86,
      "end": 185.02,
      "text": "that they themselves have witnessed.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00259
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 185.02,
      "end": 189.54,
      "text": "This was the largest audience to ever witness an inauguration, period.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00259
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 189.54,
      "end": 195.06,
      "text": "All of these are ways in which new information can enter somebody's memory",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00259
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 195.06,
      "end": 199.86,
      "text": "and cause a transformation, an alteration, a contamination",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00259
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 199.86,
      "end": 203.42,
      "text": "in that original person's memory.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00259
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 203.42,
      "end": 207.69,
      "text": "Those aren't your memories, they're somebody else's.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216694,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000368
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 207.69,
      "end": 212.69,
      "text": "Using these insights, researchers wanted to see if they could go one step further.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216694,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000368
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 212.69,
      "end": 215.69,
      "text": "What you can do is you can get people to come into the lab.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216694,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000368
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 215.69,
      "end": 220.89,
      "text": "You can tell them that they experienced something that never actually happened.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216694,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000368
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 220.89,
      "end": 223.37,
      "text": "When you're 14 years old, you initiated a physical fight",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216694,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000368
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 223.37,
      "end": 225.37,
      "text": "under the force of your parents.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216694,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000368
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 225.37,
      "end": 229.65,
      "text": "That's, I don't feel like I've ever been in a fight.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216694,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000368
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 229.65,
      "end": 231.57,
      "text": "I was so confused.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.216694,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000368
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 231.57,
      "end": 235.81,
      "text": "Over the course of three interviews, you get them to repeatedly imagine",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.201578,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 235.81,
      "end": 238.53,
      "text": "what could have happened and what could have happened",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.201578,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 238.53,
      "end": 243.29,
      "text": "starts to turn into what would have happened, which turns into what did happen.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.201578,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 243.29,
      "end": 253.22,
      "text": "Remember, like a verbal fight and maybe I seem so unlike,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.201578,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 253.22,
      "end": 255.78,
      "text": "but maybe I pushed for something.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.201578,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 255.78,
      "end": 256.98,
      "text": "Good, okay.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.201578,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 256.98,
      "end": 259.9,
      "text": "And so what you're doing is you're activating their imagination",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.201578,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 259.9,
      "end": 262.74,
      "text": "and you're activating real fragments of memories,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.201578,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000646
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 262.78,
      "end": 267.14,
      "text": "of things that they can remember, like their best friends, their family members.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000227
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 267.14,
      "end": 270.94,
      "text": "And in the end, what you've done is you've created a whole fictional representation,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000227
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 270.94,
      "end": 273.78,
      "text": "a whole memory of something that never actually happened.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000227
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 273.78,
      "end": 277.18,
      "text": "You can see how this can have major consequences.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000227
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 277.18,
      "end": 280.1,
      "text": "It doesn't really matter what happened on my first day of school.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000227
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 280.1,
      "end": 282.78,
      "text": "No one is really interested except me.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000227
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 282.78,
      "end": 287.98,
      "text": "But if memory is this unstable, can it be relied upon when it's really needed,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000227
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 287.98,
      "end": 290.5,
      "text": "like in a court of law?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.130121,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000227
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 290.5,
      "end": 293.3,
      "text": "We're going to be able to prove to you in this case",
